<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="667921992"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:58.693"><div begin="23.579" end="51.714" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.579" end="29.240" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.579" end="24.008">一九</span><span begin="24.008" end="24.512">九</span><span begin="24.512" end="24.826">五</span><span begin="24.826" end="25.310">年</span> <span begin="26.409" end="27.117">我们在</span><span begin="27.117" end="27.803">机场</span><span begin="27.803" end="28.532">的车</span><span begin="28.532" end="29.240">站</span></p><p begin="30.455" end="35.119" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.455" end="30.647">你</span><span begin="30.647" end="31.018">借</span><span begin="31.018" end="31.419">我</span> <span begin="32.068" end="32.787">而我</span><span begin="32.787" end="33.953">不想</span><span begin="33.953" end="34.292">归</span><span begin="34.292" end="35.119">还</span></p><p begin="37.347" end="44.602" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.347" end="38.184">那个</span><span begin="38.184" end="39.906">背包</span><span begin="40.141" end="41.277">载满</span><span begin="41.819" end="42.912">纪念品</span><span begin="42.912" end="43.524">和</span><span begin="43.524" end="43.900">患</span><span begin="43.900" end="44.602">难</span></p><p begin="45.694" end="51.714" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.694" end="46.373">还有</span><span begin="46.373" end="47.331">摩擦</span><span begin="47.331" end="47.682">留</span><span begin="47.682" end="48.573">下</span><span begin="48.573" end="49.194">的</span><span begin="49.194" end="50.353">图</span><span begin="50.353" end="51.714">案</span></p></div><div begin="52.520" end="1:21.770" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="52.520" end="59.867" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.520" end="53.482">你的</span><span begin="53.482" end="54.371">背</span><span begin="54.371" end="55.763">包</span> <span begin="57.070" end="57.454">背</span><span begin="57.454" end="58.222">到现在</span><span begin="58.222" end="58.677">还</span><span begin="58.677" end="59.113">没</span><span begin="59.113" end="59.867">烂</span></p><p begin="1:00.926" end="1:06.163" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.926" end="1:02.542">却成为</span><span begin="1:02.542" end="1:02.829">我</span><span begin="1:02.829" end="1:03.402">身</span><span begin="1:03.402" end="1:03.917">体</span><span begin="1:03.917" end="1:04.414">另</span><span begin="1:04.414" end="1:04.846">一</span><span begin="1:04.846" end="1:06.163">半</span></p><p begin="1:07.774" end="1:15.117" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.774" end="1:08.775">千金</span><span begin="1:08.775" end="1:09.776">不</span><span begin="1:09.776" end="1:10.777">换</span> <span begin="1:12.395" end="1:12.772">它</span><span begin="1:12.772" end="1:13.526">已熟悉</span><span begin="1:13.527" end="1:14.022">我</span><span begin="1:14.022" end="1:14.369">的</span><span begin="1:14.369" end="1:15.117">汗</span></p><p begin="1:16.228" end="1:21.770" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.228" end="1:16.876">它</span><span begin="1:16.876" end="1:17.828">是我</span><span begin="1:17.828" end="1:18.526">肩膀</span><span begin="1:18.526" end="1:19.031">上</span><span begin="1:19.031" end="1:19.695">的</span><span begin="1:19.977" end="1:20.349">指</span><span begin="1:20.349" end="1:21.770">环</span></p></div><div begin="1:28.321" end="1:56.447" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:28.321" end="1:34.046" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.321" end="1:28.741">背了</span><span begin="1:28.741" end="1:29.575">六年</span><span begin="1:29.575" end="1:30.202">半</span> <span begin="1:31.184" end="1:31.872">我每一</span><span begin="1:31.872" end="1:32.230">天</span><span begin="1:32.230" end="1:32.722">陪它</span><span begin="1:32.722" end="1:33.234">上</span><span begin="1:33.234" end="1:34.046">班</span></p><p begin="1:35.191" end="1:39.915" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.191" end="1:35.389">你</span><span begin="1:35.389" end="1:3